WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
What can you clean up?
This example uses a saved scan of a demo folder.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
In Folder Atlas, select “Review with Codex”.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Codex opens a draft. Edit it if you like, then send it.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.000
“Show what takes up the most space
and recommend what to clean up first.”

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.200
Codex found 48 MiB in Downloads, 80% of the demo folder.
It recommended checking two installers first.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.000
Editor 2.1 uses 32 MiB.
The older 2.0 installer uses 16 MiB.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Codex asks, “Do you need version 2.0
for older projects or to roll back?” Reply in the chat.
